ng to come get you otherwise. Like Barack Obama was nicknamed the Deporter-in-Chief and to his credit was deporting three million people a year. Tell him like it is. Okay, but at the same time also furthering this idiotic notion Okay, that, you know, the dreamers and no person is illegal and everybody should add it. Don't be thick. All right. No, it was stupid. Obama is part of the Biden mindset is part of the woke mindset in Washington that border security is somehow racist. Now they don't believe that. but they find it to be politically viable. Okay, you know the border is the front door of your house. Of course you lock the front door. It's not because you're racist, because you just want to know who's coming in the house in the middle of the night when you're not paying attention. In this instance, our border patrol has testified under oath to losing operational control of three critical sectors along our southern border. And we're about to repeal if the Biden administration has their way, Title 42. Okay, Biden is asking the judge the Supreme Court to wait till after Christmas and blah, blah, blah, blah. The point is, okay, Title 42 is something that predates Trump. It's almost 100 years old. And it was there to screen people coming into this country for health issues, like major contagions. It's nothing against them. It doesn't mean we don't like them. It doesn't mean we don't wish them well. We're not saying they're bad people. But if folks are coming to this country during a pandemic from other countries where there are lax health standards, you run the risk of creating a bigger problem in your own country. That was the point of Title 42. But the Biden administration, because Title 42 is invoked by Trump, okay, the Biden administration was like, that's bad. Oh, it's racist. It's not good. No, we can't have it. Let's get rid of it. So on the one end, they're going to yell and scream at you about being vaxxed and boosted because we're in a global pandemic. But 