    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/3/93675.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 202,
    "turn_text": "Well, the president has to implement the law. And as you know, the law allows for anybody presenting himself at the Southern border to apply for asylum and to stay in the United States while they make that case and that claim. Many of us would argue that President Trump went above his statutory authority in denying many people the ability to make that claim.",
