      },
      {
        "text": "Murphy fails to acknowledge that Biden’s policy change caused the increase in asylum seekers.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Joe Biden enacted the policy change that replaced 'Remain in Mexico'.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Asylum seekers apprehended after the repeal are now allowed into the country.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The 'Remain in Mexico' policy served as a deterrent to illegal immigration.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The 'Remain in Mexico' policy reduced the ability of drug cartels to facilitate unauthorized entry into the U.S.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The current surge in asylum seekers is attributable to Biden’s reversal of the 'Remain in Mexico' policy.",
