  {
    "episode_id": 93675,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/3/93675.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 231,
    "turn_text": "Well, that, that this point, they are stuck on stupid. And they don't want to admit that they're wrong. And this even goes back way before 2020. This goes back to our vice president being named the borders are and not once does she ever visit the border. This is an administration that's actually more interested in adding 87,000 more IRS agents. And let me put this in perspective, we're going to have 166,000 IRS agents at a time Joe Biden is done and only 15,000 border agents. So you tell me where this administration's priorities are. We've had 5 million people that we know of illegally enter our country. We've had an ephemeral to enter our country to kill every single American five times. And yet this administration still stands by idly and allows un-American things to be happening at the border every single day. So it's up to us with this new Congress, the 118th Congress, to take control of the American value that we were talking about. And one of those things is border security and maintaining our sovereignty as a nation. There's a derelict of duty with current administration and we have to have to provide this shift.",
