    "turn_text": "Imagine that. I mean, it's so fascinating because you have to be indifferent to people. You have to not care to allow this to go on and say, oh, I don't know. Maybe we'll even make it a little bit worse. And that's the thing I feel like you're up against. You are a West Point grad. You go in there with your heart in the right place. But I think you're going to find out pretty quickly that it's really like one party in DC. The fact that there's 15 of you saying, we should oppose the spending bill. Uh, you know, that's you guys are the outliers. Most people are like, hey, shut up hunt. I got money for my district here. And that's the way it works. So you're going to have to be, you know, we were talking about Andre Carter, the star linebacker, you know, you're going to have to play some good ball yourself, man.",
